8":-5,"_99":100,"_101":102,"_103":-5,"_104":105,"_106":100,"_107":108},"itemId","y98e1fdfgn4yv1brirfigyskl","亚马逊升级 Seller Assistant，并推出 Amazon Quick 与 Claude 插件","summary","亚马逊为 Seller Assistant 加入持久记忆和可 24/7 运行的自动化工作流，卖家可用自然语言设定规则，由系统监控库存、定价等条件并执行操作，所有动作带完整审计记录。","sourceName","About Amazon · 创新","sourceUrl","https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/innovation-at-amazon/seller-assistant-plugin-amazon-quick-claude?utm_source=rss","sourceId","rss-about-amazon-innovation","sourceIconUrl","firstParty",true,"role","精选阅读","storyPublicId","publishedAt","2026-09-23T13:00:08.829Z","available","label","精选阅读 · 非当日新闻","z1ae5umsoiaz4e3pekd8rzypw","亚马逊在 Seller Central 推出多平台销售工具，可管理 eBay、Shopify、TikTok 和 Walmart 销售","亚马逊在 Seller Central 上线多平台销售工具，卖家可将 eBay、Shopify、TikTok 和 Walmart 账号接入，在同一后台管理 Listing、订单与利润数据。","About Amazon · 小企业与卖家","https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/small-business/amazon-seller-central-multichannel-selling-tools?utm_source=rss","rss-about-amazon-smb","2026-09-24T13:00:11.009Z","kkjcq0dlai7yf5mylgg4qgm7x","亚马逊 MCF 上线自有网站 Prime 配送与履约费折扣计划","亚马逊宣布 Amazon Supply Chain Services 推出两项面向美国卖家的新服务：MCF 商家可在自有网站免费添加快速免费的 Prime 配送。","About Amazon · 零售","https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/amazon-mcf-prime-delivery-merchant-websites?utm_source=rss","rss-about-amazon-retail","2026-09-24T09:58:21.172Z","cb0bx2oyx6w2b0qzp91pkyl74","亚马逊美国站2026旺季配送附加费10月15日生效，与3.5%燃油附加费叠加","亚马逊美国站2026年假日旺季配送附加费将于2026年10月15日至2027年1月14日生效，覆盖FBA配送、FBA远程配送、多渠道配送（MCF）及Buy with Prime等服务，费用以仓库实际出库时间核算，退货后已扣费用不予退还。","AMZ123 · SUMMER","https://amz123.com/t/PpG3ugHR","author-amz123-summer","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/0083c7bf2225c6c0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/0083c7bf2225c6c0.webp 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/0083c7bf2225c6c0.webp 96w",false,"2026-09-08T02:48:51.000Z","rhmiwexm7pheu2c0u9cot5t1o","亚马逊11月2日起要求11类商品卖家持有100万美元责任险","亚马逊发布通知，自2026年11月2日起，销售儿童用品、化妆品、可食用及可摄入产品、锂电池产品等11类增强安全要求商品的卖家，无论月销售额多少都必须持有至少100万美元的商业责任保险，新商品和现有商品同样适用。","https://www.amz123.com/t/7zPsBP3K","202